+## AI Growth Operating System (Phase 1)
+
+The console is evolving into a multi-tenant, white-label **AI Growth Operating System**. Phase 1 adds:
+
+| Module | What it does |
+|---|---|
+| **AI Command Center** (`/command-center`) | Describe an outcome in plain English. The AI operator looks up CRM data and prepares changes under per-category permissions (Observe / Recommend / Ask approval / Act automatically). Every action is audited |
+| **CRM** (`/crm`) | Contacts with explainable lead scores, a drag-and-drop pipeline, tasks, and a contact timeline with consent and privacy controls |
